ame>Cardenas</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>McKibbin</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Jeste</surname><given-names>DV</given-names></name><name><surname>Patterson</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reducing emergency medical service use in patients with chronic psychotic disorders: results from the FAST intervention study</article-title><source>Behavioral Research and Therapy</source><year>2008</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>145</fpage><lpage>153</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.brat.2007.10.001</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>